    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under the Section (I) of 66 (C) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and the provision of section 66 (G) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance, I do hereby informed that the name mentioned below was elected and declared by me as Vice Chairman of Irakkamam Pradeshiya Sabha in Ampara District with the Co - Chaired of Hon. Chairman of Pradeshiya Sabha, Irakkamam in the meeting held on the day of 26.12.2025 at 10.00 a.m. at the Irakkamam Pradeshiya Sabha Hall.",
